quadrf (1.0.2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * KasmVNC session keeps GRC Qt windows on DISPLAY :1. dbus-launch now
    execs the session so the bus survives; Qt/SDL/GTK are forced onto X11
    so HDMI/vc4 KMS does not steal the framebuffer.
  * quadrf-desktop depends on dbus-x11, wmctrl, x11-utils and
    x11-xserver-utils (xev/xrandr/wmctrl were invoked without packages).
  * Seed QRadioLink with Soapy MIPI (driver=mipi, RX/TX, 4 Msps, 8192-pt
    FFT). Rewrite leftover Pluto and ZMQ thin-client (driver=quadrf)
    device args on apply.
  * GRC File Open bookmark for /usr/share/quadrf/grc; Openbox raises
    generated python3 Qt windows.

